%[text] # Create Floor-plan Using App
%[text] 
%[text] Copyright 2026 The MathWorks, Inc.
%[text] 
%[text] You can create a building floor plan using App and save the floor-plan data in a file on your project root directory.
%[text] - To launch the app, run the command below at the MATLAB Command prompt. \
FloorPlanBuilderApp %[output:12c1d3d0]
%[text] - Click on `Help` button for the App to look at it's detailed documentation.
%[text] - Click on the video below for a quick start to the App. \
%[text] ![](text:video:5ba5)
%[text] The floor-plan data is saved in a file name specified by you. Copy the code or add code to specify windows, vents, etc. to complete the building definition. To learn more about how to create building, see [Create Building Model Part](file:/local-ssd/vikrants/26a_BuildingEnergy/Workflow/CreateBuildingModelPart.m) workflow. The App is used to `Define Rooms` and `Define Apartments` for a building model interactively.
